	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Isn't Masada desperately short on population...?)", "Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("He was an elderly man with a white beard, probably in his sixties, wearing a small black skullcap with an ID badge pinned to the collar of his suit.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("He patiently guided everyone as they picked up brochure leaflets, smiling kindly as he responded to each person who asked him something.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Curious, I edged closer. He was introducing the museum's history to a few visitors--")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Although many precious relics were destroyed in the war together with the original national museum.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("In recent years, however, this new museum has collected many precious artifacts from West Asia and Africa, allowing them to escape the ravages of war...", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I glanced at the Egyptian mummy and bronze mask printed on the back of the brochure.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_medical","wail")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(So you just stole them from those places, huh!)", "Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("But nowadays, most precious historical artifacts around the world are kept by the Six Academy Cities anyway, so this kind of thing is hardly unusual.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I noticed that while he spoke with great emotion, his left hand stayed tucked into his suit pocket the whole time.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_medical","bored")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Maybe it's some special religious custom...)", "Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I looked around. Fortunately, today wasn't the Sabbath, so there weren't many visitors, and there were no other members of the medical organization in the museum either.")
