	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I wandered around in boredom, and my eyes were soon drawn to a few locals and over a dozen children touring the place at the same time.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Among them, the most eye-catching were two men in their forties--both had large beards and strange little braids hanging from the hair at their temples.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("They were dressed the same: white shirts, black knee-length coats, and black flat-crowned hats with curled brims, like people from some strange organization.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The dozen or so children followed around those men, and both boys and girls wore the same black-and-white outfits.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_medical","bored")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Is this a school field trip from nearby?)
(But the age range at this school is kind of wild...)", "Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The children ranged evenly from about three or four years old to around ten; the youngest could barely walk steadily, while some of the older kids were yelling and roughhousing.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Behind the group trudged two weary-looking middle-aged women with sagging figures.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_medical","stare")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Those two aren't the teachers... are they?)", "Ren")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Why is one of them even pushing a stroller?)", "Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("What a weird combination...")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The history hall tour ended quickly, and the guide started leading everyone to the document hall.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("He adjusted the microphone clipped to his collar and cleared his throat--")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Next, I will show you the most important exhibit in this museum.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Photography is prohibited in the next hall. Please put away your phones and follow me into the Shrine of the Book.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The moment they heard that, the rowdy children fell silent, and the two men in black also grew solemn.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I put away my phone and followed with curiosity burning in my chest.")
	await novel_interface.hide_background()
	await novel_interface.stop_music()
