	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Jacob later became Masada's holy patriarch, and his twelve sons became the twelve forefathers of Masada's tribes...", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("By this point my head was starting to throb.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Hold on... red bean stew? What the hell!?
