	await novel_interface.show_dialog("We were driven from our homeland again and again, forced out of our own homes.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("We were conquered, ruled, marginalized, slaughtered, treated as slaves, prisoners, even livestock...", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("A century ago, in one of the most appalling ethnic purges in human history, six million of our compatriots were massacred.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("And ten years ago, our capital was once again reduced to scorched earth. Temple Mount burned in purple flames for seven days and seven nights...", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Many people--my family and friends--lost their lives in that catastrophe.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("And those who survived by sheer luck may have lost even more...", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("His voice trembled as he raised the left hand that had been tucked in his pocket.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Only then did we see that the hand had been replaced by a metal prosthesis, and burns covered the wrist and forearm exposed beyond the sleeve...")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The entire room fell silent. I found myself holding my breath too.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("A young tourist girl in the crowd covered her mouth with both hands, tears welling in her eyes.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("But the guide clenched that hand into a fist and raised it high, looking at us as he spoke in a resolute voice--")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("And yet, just like those thousand warriors who defended this fortress to the end, suffering will never make us submit.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("His voice wasn't loud, but it was filled with heroic spirit, and it made a strange strength well up in my chest.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("His eyes shone as though he could see a god pointing the way.")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("We have endured two great diasporas, yet in the end we will always return to this land, because suffering will never make us submit--", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Ninety years ago, our forebears braved gunfire and shells just to return here once more and establish a nation of our own.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Even if this was nothing but a barren desert, even if fresh water was scarcely available then, this is our home!", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("What flows across this land is not milk and honey, but our blood, tears, and sweat.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("This is our only homeland in the world, and the spiritual home the Masadan people have cherished for thousands of years.", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("The \"Promised Land\" is the covenant between our ancestors and God, and also our promise to future generations--", "Guide")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("The Temple may be burned, but the fortress of the spirit will never fall!", "Guide")
